2. Create a student contact database that maps student roll numbers to email addresses,
allowing administrators to look up contact info instantly by entering a roll ID.


# Student Contact Database

# Store roll numbers and email addresses
students = {
    101: "student101@gmail.com",
    102: "student102@gmail.com",
    103: "student103@gmail.com",
    104: "student104@gmail.com"
}

# Enter roll number
roll = int(input("Enter student roll number: "))

# Search for email
if roll in students:
    print("Email Address:", students[roll])
else:
    print("Student not found.")
